				<li>Extends continuously from -5 to 1,000 km, smoothing USSA's 86 km discontinuity, and includes more gases with up-to-date concentrations</li>
				<li>Lower-atmosphere molar mass is 28.9659 g/mol versus USSA's 28.9644 — gap widens above 86 km but stays small</li>
			</ul>
